menu "BMC application"

    config BMC_TEST_HOOKS
        bool "Enable validation test hooks (TESTSET / TESTINJECT commands)"
        default y
        help
            Lets the host lower the over-temperature limit and force fault
            conditions, which the validation plan needs (FSR 3.2.5.1.2 and
            3.2.5.1.3). The limit can only be lowered, never raised above 120 C,
            and every record carries a flag while the hooks are compiled in.
            Turn this OFF for the final demonstration build.

    config BMC_INLET_SENSOR
        bool "A second TMP117 measures inlet (ambient) air"
        default n
        help
            Adds the inlet temperature to telemetry and the self-test and uses
            it for the "start from ambient" check before a profile run.

    config BMC_INLET_I2C_ADDR
        hex "I2C address of the inlet TMP117"
        depends on BMC_INLET_SENSOR
        default 0x49

endmenu
